<view class="page"><view class="h1">设置</view><view class="label">服务状态</view><view class="row between setting"><text>解析引擎</text><view class="badge">{{health ? (health.extractor ? '已就绪' : '待安装') : '未连接'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{health}}" class="muted tiny limits">最大 {{health.maxMb}} MB · 最长 {{health.maxDuration / 60}} 分钟 · 临时保留 {{health.ttl / 60}} 分钟</view><view class="label">平台解析器</view><view class="platform-list"><text wx:for="{{platforms}}" wx:key="id">{{item.name}}</text></view><view class="muted tiny note">可用性取决于平台访问策略和视频源。原画质按平台实际可获取的最高画质保存。</view><block wx:if="{{demoMode}}"><view class="label">开发服务地址</view><input value="{{baseUrl}}" bindinput="input"/><button class="secondary save" bindtap="save">保存地址</button></block><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="label">权限与隐私</view><button class="setting row between" bindtap="albumSettings"><text>相册权限</text><image class="icon" src="/assets/chevron-right.png" /></button><button class="setting row between" bindtap="privacy"><text>隐私保护指引</text><image class="icon" src="/assets/chevron-right.png" /></button><view class="version muted tiny">留影去水印助手 1.0.2</view></view>
